{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02913","headline":"赠右台监察邓茂迁左台殿中 · 刘怀一","name":"赠右台监察邓茂迁左台殿中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟昔参多士，无双仰异才。\n鹰鸇同效逐，鵷鹭忝游陪。\n入仕光三命，迁荣历二台。\n隔墙钦素躅，对问限清埃。\n紫署春光早，兰闱曙色催。\n谁言夕鸟至，空想邓林隈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘怀一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}